+The producer refuses to overwrite a final panel, authenticates the exact-source sidecars, uses checkpoint-keyed resume fragments, fails closed on incompatible feature widths or incomplete certificates, and never writes to the source, PANELCEIL, selector, retraining, or virtual-environment workspaces.
